{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00312",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.02,
      "end_seconds": 3.37,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "Right, hi. Thanks for coming in today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 3.92,
      "end_seconds": 5.87,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "Evening, you know, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.0,
      "end_seconds": 8.03,
      "duration_seconds": 1.03,
      "text": "Was parking alright?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 9.27,
      "end_seconds": 13.27,
      "duration_seconds": 4.0,
      "text": "Not great, I ended up a few streets away."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 14.53,
      "end_seconds": 16.38,
      "duration_seconds": 1.85,
      "text": "What seems to be the problem?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 16.93,
      "end_seconds": 24.88,
      "duration_seconds": 7.95,
      "text": "I've been putting on weight over the last year. I'd rather know what's going on than keep guessing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 26.14,
      "end_seconds": 27.79,
      "duration_seconds": 1.65,
      "text": "And when did that start?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 29.33,
      "end_seconds": 31.63,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3,
      "text": "I've had it for two months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 32.09,
      "end_seconds": 44.1,
      "duration_seconds": 12.01,
      "text": "It's quite normal to feel unsure at this point. People often expect an instant answer, but a good assessment usually has a few stages, and today is mainly about narrowing things down and making a sensible plan together."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 44.98,
      "end_seconds": 46.49,
      "duration_seconds": 1.51,
      "text": "That's reassuring to hear."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 51.02,
      "end_seconds": 54.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "Any palpitations, increased thirst or low mood at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 55.79,
      "end_seconds": 60.01,
      "duration_seconds": 4.22,
      "text": "I haven't had palpitations, increased thirst or low mood, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 61.14,
      "end_seconds": 75.17,
      "duration_seconds": 14.03,
      "text": "I'll be straight with you about how this works. Most of what we see in clinic turns out to be manageable, and the history you give me is often more useful than any single test, so thank you for being so detailed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 76.6,
      "end_seconds": 78.65,
      "duration_seconds": 2.05,
      "text": "Thank you, that really helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 79.18,
      "end_seconds": 80.22,
      "duration_seconds": 1.04,
      "text": "Any regular medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 81.74,
      "end_seconds": 82.67,
      "duration_seconds": 0.93,
      "text": "Nothing, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 83.48,
      "end_seconds": 86.11,
      "duration_seconds": 2.63,
      "text": "Alright, is the room warm enough for you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 89.92,
      "end_seconds": 91.65,
      "duration_seconds": 1.73,
      "text": "It's perfect, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 92.05,
      "end_seconds": 93.1,
      "duration_seconds": 1.05,
      "text": "Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 94.1,
      "end_seconds": 96.45,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "No, never had any surgery."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 97.14,
      "end_seconds": 100.95,
      "duration_seconds": 3.81,
      "text": "Okay, do you have everything you need to get home alright?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 101.35,
      "end_seconds": 113.22,
      "duration_seconds": 11.87,
      "text": "Yes, I've got my transport sorted. It's a bit of a trek, but I'm used to the journey by now, and I brought something to read for the wait."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 114.43,
      "end_seconds": 117.53,
      "duration_seconds": 3.1,
      "text": "Do you have any known allergies at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 119.05,
      "end_seconds": 122.89,
      "duration_seconds": 3.84,
      "text": "Yes, latex, it gives me a rash on my hands."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 123.98,
      "end_seconds": 127.79,
      "duration_seconds": 3.81,
      "text": "Sorry, I'm just writing a few notes, bear with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 128.93,
      "end_seconds": 130.93,
      "duration_seconds": 2.0,
      "text": "No problem, take your time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 132.03,
      "end_seconds": 137.57,
      "duration_seconds": 5.54,
      "text": "Do you have any medical conditions I should know about? Take your time, there's no rush."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 138.28,
      "end_seconds": 140.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "No, nothing, I've generally been healthy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 141.3,
      "end_seconds": 144.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "Do you have any questions before we carry on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 145.41,
      "end_seconds": 157.27,
      "duration_seconds": 11.86,
      "text": "Not at the moment, I think you've covered most of what I was wondering. If something comes to mind later, I'll ask you before I leave."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 158.49,
      "end_seconds": 160.63,
      "duration_seconds": 2.14,
      "text": "Let me check your vitals now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 172.35,
      "end_seconds": 173.89,
      "duration_seconds": 1.54,
      "text": "Hold still for me..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 195.81,
      "end_seconds": 199.82,
      "duration_seconds": 4.01,
      "text": "Okay: BP is 126 over 80, temp 36.7 degrees, pulse 83."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 202.96,
      "end_seconds": 204.06,
      "duration_seconds": 1.1,
      "text": "Is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 205.56,
      "end_seconds": 208.32,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "We'll put it in context in a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 209.04,
      "end_seconds": 211.52,
      "duration_seconds": 2.48,
      "text": "I'll just check what's already recorded here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 212.37,
      "end_seconds": 213.09,
      "duration_seconds": 0.72,
      "text": "Please do."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 227.12,
      "end_seconds": 231.04,
      "duration_seconds": 3.92,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it. Did you manage to eat before coming?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 232.09,
      "end_seconds": 235.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "Yes, I had something small this morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 236.34,
      "end_seconds": 248.77,
      "duration_seconds": 12.43,
      "text": "From what you've told me, I think we're dealing with weight gain with a metabolic cause that needs checking at this stage. That's my thinking for now, and it may change as we learn more."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 249.82,
      "end_seconds": 252.43,
      "duration_seconds": 2.61,
      "text": "Is this going to go away?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 252.95,
      "end_seconds": 272.76,
      "duration_seconds": 19.81,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like weight gain with a metabolic cause that needs checking, but I'd like to confirm. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've been putting on weight over the last year for two months, and no low mood or palpitations."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 273.27,
      "end_seconds": 274.72,
      "duration_seconds": 1.45,
      "text": "Yes, that's right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 276.2,
      "end_seconds": 279.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.09,
      "text": "I want to open your previous notes quickly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 279.89,
      "end_seconds": 280.65,
      "duration_seconds": 0.76,
      "text": "Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 290.33,
      "end_seconds": 317.11,
      "duration_seconds": 26.78,
      "text": "Right, thanks for waiting. We should do a lipid profile for metabolic risk. Start with small, specific changes: smaller portions, no sugary drinks, a thirty-minute walk most days. Try to keep a simple diary of when it happens and what you were doing, and bring it to the next visit. Please don't sit on it if the symptoms get worse. That's the point to get seen urgently."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 317.47,
      "end_seconds": 318.84,
      "duration_seconds": 1.37,
      "text": "Okay, I understand."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 319.94,
      "end_seconds": 321.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.03,
      "text": "Let's review you in six weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 325.97,
      "end_seconds": 328.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "Okay, you know, I'll book that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 329.29,
      "end_seconds": 335.06,
      "duration_seconds": 5.77,
      "text": "Let me check that I've been clear. What will you do once you get home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 336.1,
      "end_seconds": 341.79,
      "duration_seconds": 5.69,
      "text": "So, you know, I come back in six weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 343.01,
      "end_seconds": 346.64,
      "duration_seconds": 3.63,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Okay, we're done for today. Take care."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 347.08,
      "end_seconds": 350.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.15,
      "text": "That's all, thank you for your time."
    }
  ]
}